  "system": {
    "identifier": "inuzuka-tail-chasing-fang",
    "description": "<p>As part of the requirements of this jutsu, you must have the Two-Headed Wolf form. An ultra-violent variation on the Fang Wolf Fang technique where you curl into a ball and roll at a ferocious speed, in a spiral shape, crushing and gouging everything in your way while you roll sideways, as if chasing after your own tail.</p>\n<p>You begin to ravage all creatures of your choice in a 40-foot radius centered on you. All creatures of your choice in range, must make a Dexterity saving throw taking your Bite + 3d8 slashing &amp; 3d8 piercing damage, and have their defenses shredded, reducing their AC and DR by 4 until the beginning of your next turn on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p>",
